  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PACJA - Cap build for effective CSO coordination  &amp; engagement in CC dialogue p - Pan Africa Climate Justice Alliance (PACJA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PACJA - Kapacitetsutv. f&#xF6;r civila samh&#xE4;llets deltagande i klimatf&#xF6;rhandlingar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;det till PACJA &#xE4;r ett organisationsst&#xF6;d som kommer att st&#xF6;dja      organisationen i utvecklingen av institutionell kapacitet f&#xF6;r att     koordinera andra civila samh&#xE4;llsorganisationer i Afrika i en str&#xE4;van  mot rimlighet och r&#xE4;ttvisa inom klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndring. Medlen ska g&#xF6;ra det m&#xF6;jligt att ha ett verksamt sekretariat, en bra                       koordineringsmekanism, och st&#xF6;d till gr&#xE4;srotsorganisationers aktivite</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to PACJA is a core support that will support the          organization develop institutional capacity to coordinate other civil society organizations in Africa to pursue fairness and justice in     climate change. The funds are to enable it have a working             secretariat, a good coordination mechanism, and support to grassroots activities that are to be undertaken in partnership with its members.</narrative>
  </description>
